      "scope": "Registered Tormentor Primary Target core only; summoned entity payloads and external producers remain separate finite-census contracts.",
      "actual_behavior": "Native effect tick: if tormentor_target and Player, refreshes PLACEHOLDER_PACK item cooldown3. Sky-visible/head not IMMORTAL_HELMET and intensity<=120 adds2 to PlayerVariables torment_intensity. If nottormentor_target, unhelmeted, intensity>119 OR non-Overworld/non-Nether with empty y+2..5, and respite<=5: cycle<=0 clears limitsummons and resets cycle uniformly1000..2000; sequential fresh rolls choose spider_rain(1/5), else locust_rain(1/3), else effects(1/2), else enemies. Existing positive cycle only decreases1 with armor>0. Effects mode tests cycle<fresh uniform1..1000: first 1/8 branch is overlay-only; else fresh1/2 branch may spawn native LightningBolt at recipient block when Scorpioid advancement/map flag, armor>1 and fresh1/20; final else applies Blindness60/1, Darkness60/1, Poison200/1 independently of hurt. Enemies mode requires Voidlasher advancement/map flag, armor>1 and fresh1/60: all ARTHROPOD entities in AABB inflation50 receive Strength1200/4 on server LivingEntity; each Mob has independent1/6 chance to target recipient, without team exclusion. Then100 random candidate positions, XYZ inclusive[-40,40], require empty current/nonempty below; each accepted position increments limitsummons BEFORE <=15 gate. Active summon chain: Dreadnought1/70; else guaranteed nextInt(1,1)==1 enters nested Prowler1/100 (+attempted zoniex:tormented_steve command at recipient origin), else sequential1/2 rolls select RandomTermite/ScorpionStriker, CentipedeStalker+EvictorLarvae, or SpiderFunnel. Trailing Hornet/Mosquito/Fly loop is unreachable behind the guaranteed1..1 branch. Spider rain additionally needs Moth advancement/map flag, armor>1 and cycle<fresh1..1000: one position X/Z[-40,40], Y[30,60], empty; local summonsdone increments once (<=12 is ineffective here), limitsummons<=100 before choice Brood1/10, else LongLegs1/5, else Larvae; counter increments after spawn attempt. Locust rain instead tests cycle>fresh1..1000, no progression/armor>1 gate beyond parent armor>0; same coordinate ranges, increments limitsummons BEFORE <=100 gate. Native spawned entities get zero initial motion; there is no owner/team assignment. No direct hurt, status-success gate or guaranteed external zoniex registry is invented.",
      "closest_vanilla_equivalent": "Custom torment mode/cycle and encounter pressure; native item cooldown, MobEffect requests, target changes, entity summons and default LightningBolt remain distinct.",
      "vanilla_similarities": "Uses the named native APIs/components below; native admission, stacking and defenses remain authoritative.",
      "vanilla_differences": "Native effect tick: if tormentor_target and Player, refreshes PLACEHOLDER_PACK item cooldown3. Sky-visible/head not IMMORTAL_HELMET and intensity<=120 adds2 to PlayerVariables torment_intensity. If nottormentor_target, unhelmeted, intensity>119 OR non-Overworld/non-Nether with empty y+2..5, and respite<=5: cycle<=0 clears limitsummons and resets cycle uniformly1000..2000; sequential fresh rolls choose spider_rain(1/5), else locust_rain(1/3), else effects(1/2), else enemies. Existing positive cycle only decreases1 with armor>0. Effects mode tests cycle<fresh uniform1..1000: first 1/8 branch is overlay-only; else fresh1/2 branch may spawn native LightningBolt at recipient block when Scorpioid advancement/map flag, armor>1 and fresh1/20; final else applies Blindness60/1, Darkness60/1, Poison200/1 independently of hurt. Enemies mode requires Voidlasher advancement/map flag, armor>1 and fresh1/60: all ARTHROPOD entities in AABB inflation50 receive Strength1200/4 on server LivingEntity; each Mob has independent1/6 chance to target recipient, without team exclusion. Then100 random candidate positions, XYZ inclusive[-40,40], require empty current/nonempty below; each accepted position increments limitsummons BEFORE <=15 gate. Active summon chain: Dreadnought1/70; else guaranteed nextInt(1,1)==1 enters nested Prowler1/100 (+attempted zoniex:tormented_steve command at recipient origin), else sequential1/2 rolls select RandomTermite/ScorpionStriker, CentipedeStalker+EvictorLarvae, or SpiderFunnel. Trailing Hornet/Mosquito/Fly loop is unreachable behind the guaranteed1..1 branch. Spider rain additionally needs Moth advancement/map flag, armor>1 and cycle<fresh1..1000: one position X/Z[-40,40], Y[30,60], empty; local summonsdone increments once (<=12 is ineffective here), limitsummons<=100 before choice Brood1/10, else LongLegs1/5, else Larvae; counter increments after spawn attempt. Locust rain instead tests cycle>fresh1..1000, no progression/armor>1 gate beyond parent armor>0; same coordinate ranges, increments limitsummons BEFORE <=100 gate. Native spawned entities get zero initial motion; there is no owner/team assignment. No direct hurt, status-success gate or guaranteed external zoniex registry is invented.",
